| `int n = 5;`<br>`int coeff[] = { 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 };`<br>`int exp[] = { 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 };`<br><br>`Polynomial p1;`<br>`for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i)`<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;`p1.insertTerm(coeff[i], exp[i]);`<br><br>`p1.print();` | `[`<br>`Term: (5 5)`<br>`Term: (4 4)`<br>`Term: (3 3)`<br>`Term: (2 2)`<br>`Term: (1 1)`<br`]` |

